3	/**
4	 * The customer-facing surface for the saved card that `worker/billing.ts` charges.
5	 *
6	 * Everything card-shaped in this app is REDIRECT-based: there is no Stripe.js in
7	 * the browser and no publishable key is plumbed to it, so a card number is only
8	 * ever typed on Stripe's own hosted page. Nothing in this file renders, reads or
9	 * accepts a card number, and nothing in it can — the buttons here only ever send
10	 * the customer to a URL that Stripe minted.
11	 *
12	 * The return leg is the fragile part and is handled by `CardSetupReturn` below.
13	 */
